PARITY (web source reproduced)
------------------------------------------------------------
- Data sources (prompt): useTranslation + useDateFormat. NO query hooks — the web modal's data is
  the `dashboard` SavedDashboard prop. Bound via the P1/S8 ExportModalSource seam (ExportModalInput
  carries the dashboard + date-format context + share origin + the live-state axis). No HTTP in the
  view; the production app implements the source over the dashboard store + settings holder.
- Shared components (prompt): @/components/ui (Modal/Button/Badge/CopyButton) + @/components/feedback
  (AlertBanner). Mapped to native: the shared TSButton/TSSkeleton atoms + design tokens are reused;
  the Modal chrome, Badge chips, CopyButton (copied-state), AlertBanner, and the dashboard-local
  MiniGridPreview are reproduced as scoped subviews (their atomic peers are owned by the P4
  component-library bundle, out of scope here — same approach as the AiUsageCard reference).
- Charts / maps: none (per the prompt).
- Composition: dashboard summary (MiniGridPreview of the `lg` layout + truncated name + Package
  "{{count}} widgets" chip + jsonSize chip + "Updated {{date}}") over three export actions
  (primary "Download JSON File" -> onDownload + onClose; ghost "Copy to Clipboard" -> pretty
  dashboard JSON; ghost "Copy Shareable URL" -> origin+/dashboard#import=<base64url(minimal)>).
- Web arithmetic reproduced + unit-tested (do-not-fix): dashboardJson = JSON.stringify(d,null,2);
  jsonSize = bytes<1024 ? "{bytes} B" : "{(bytes/1024).toFixed(1)} KB" over UTF-8 byte size;
  buildMinimalExport {name,widgets:[{id,widgetId,config?}],layouts}; toUrlSafeBase64 (+->-, /->_,
  strip =); shareUrl > 2000 -> disabled share-copy + warning banner (export.urlTooLong).
- States (all rendered — no hidden surface): loading (skeleton), empty (zero widgets — friendly
  message), error (P4 leaf QueryError + retry), data, + orthogonal connection axis live/stale/offline
  (freshness chip + banner, one-shot auto-refresh on stale). shareUrlTooLong is a data sub-state.
- i18n: all 7 source keys (export.title/widgetCount/updated/downloadFile/copyClipboard/copyShareUrl/
  urlTooLong) + native chrome keys via the P1/S10 facade. No English string literals in Swift code
  (verified: every referenced key has a catalog entry and every catalog entry is referenced).
- Accessibility: combined VoiceOver labels on summary chips/options, header isHeader trait, close
  button label, freshness a11y label; Dynamic-Type system fonts (Font.TS); reduce-motion honored
  (TSFadeIn + TSSkeleton gated). iOS 18 / macOS 15 minimums.
- Telemetry (P1/S11): emits view.opened with surface slug "ExportModal" on the first applied snapshot
  (ExportModalTelemetry seam; OSLog default).

